---
import LegalPageLayout from "../layouts/LegalPageLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";
---

<LegalPageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Global Bash Tax Services"
  description="Privacy information for visitors using the Global Bash Tax Services website."
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  canonicalPath="/privacy-policy/"
  effectiveDate="August 9, 2026"
>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how Global Bash collects,
    uses, protects, and shares information submitted
    through this website.
  </p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

  <p>
    We may collect your name, email address, phone number,
    preferred contact method, preferred language, requested
    service, and the general message you submit.
  </p>

  <h2>Do Not Submit Sensitive Tax Information</h2>

  <p>
    Do not submit Social Security numbers, taxpayer
    identification numbers, tax returns, bank information,
    identity documents, passwords, or other sensitive
    information through a public website form or regular
    email.
  </p>

  <h2>How Information Is Used</h2>

  <p>
    Submitted information may be used to review and respond
    to inquiries, coordinate consultations, determine
    whether a requested service falls within the practice’s
    scope, protect the website, and maintain appropriate
    business records.
  </p>

  <h2>Website Service Providers</h2>

  <p>
    Website information may be processed by service
    providers supporting hosting, security, bot protection,
    form handling, and transactional email delivery.
  </p>

  <h2>Information Sharing</h2>

  <p>
    Global Bash does not sell personal information
    submitted through the website. Information may be
    shared with website service providers, when required by
    law, to protect rights or security, or with your
    direction or consent.
  </p>

  <h2>Data Retention and Security</h2>

  <p>
    Website inquiry information is retained only as long as
    reasonably necessary for communication, business
    records, legal obligations, dispute resolution, and
    security. Reasonable safeguards are used, but no
    electronic system can be guaranteed completely secure.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and Essential Technologies</h2>

  <p>
    The website may use essential technologies required for
    security, bot prevention, form protection, and basic
    operation. This policy should be updated before
    additional analytics or advertising technologies are
    activated.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>

  <p>
    External websites linked from this site operate under
    their own privacy practices.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>

  <address>
    Email:
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>
      {site.email}
    </a><br />

    Phone:
    <a href={site.phoneHref}>
      {site.phoneDisplay}
    </a>
  </address>
</LegalPageLayout>